{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19048","headline":"将赴苏州途出洛阳留守李相公累申宴饯宠行话旧形於篇章谨抒下情以申仰谢 · 刘禹锡","name":"将赴苏州途出洛阳留守李相公累申宴饯宠行话旧形於篇章谨抒下情以申仰谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁杪风物动，雪余宫苑晴。\n兔园宾客至，金谷管弦声。\n洛水故人别，吴宫新燕迎。\n越郎忧不浅，怀袖有琼英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}